{"1561540": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ship of Theseus", "steam_appid": 1561540, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Reality Changes the Ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/408fa58a46307e5289e0b4be0b622bcc.poster.avif?t=1783144152\" width=1166 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/408fa58a46307e5289e0b4be0b622bcc.webm?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/408fa58a46307e5289e0b4be0b622bcc.mp4?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Theseus</strong> is drifting through deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its reactor is gone. Power is failing. Your crew is stranded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One experimental system still functions: a prototype drive capable of reaching alternate realities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in another universe lies the technology you need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The question isn't whether you'll find it...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's what you'll leave behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cooperative Procedural FPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/18ed47fb4e42964bd542e935a28a4d34.poster.avif?t=1783144152\" width=1166 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/18ed47fb4e42964bd542e935a28a4d34.webm?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/18ed47fb4e42964bd542e935a28a4d34.mp4?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside your friends through intense first-person combat against alien infestations, rogue machines, and hostile environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition takes you to <strong>a different version of reality</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations evolve between visits with new layouts, objectives, enemy encounters, environmental hazards, and secrets. Procedural generation isn't just a gameplay system—it's woven directly into the story of the multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two realities are ever quite the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Engine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/ddbbcd17f47eb08ac073a8ae60b58aa8.poster.avif?t=1783144152\" width=1166 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/ddbbcd17f47eb08ac073a8ae60b58aa8.webm?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/ddbbcd17f47eb08ac073a8ae60b58aa8.mp4?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission offers meaningful choices that shape your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful upgrades, unlock new technologies, and create devastating combinations as you prepare for increasingly dangerous expeditions and massive boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master new weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push deeper into the multiverse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Choice Has Consequences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/b780434c0a0cfd799c6dfb5f7de960c7.poster.avif?t=1783144152\" width=1166 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/b780434c0a0cfd799c6dfb5f7de960c7.webm?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/b780434c0a0cfd799c6dfb5f7de960c7.mp4?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each journey changes more than your own ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the boundaries between realities weaken, you'll uncover mysteries surrounding the <i>Theseus</i>, your missing crew, and the true purpose of the experimental drive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some realities can never be restored.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Others may still have hope.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1–4 Player Online Co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced First-Person Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally Generated Worlds Integrated Into the Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelite Progression and Build Crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powerful Weapons and Upgrade Synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alien Infestations and Massive Boss Battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Countless Alternate Versions of the Same Locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Narrative That Evolves As You Explore the Multiverse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Endings Based on Your Discoveries</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Reality Changes the Ship</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/408fa58a46307e5289e0b4be0b622bcc.poster.avif?t=1783144152\" width=1166 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/408fa58a46307e5289e0b4be0b622bcc.webm?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/408fa58a46307e5289e0b4be0b622bcc.mp4?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Theseus</strong> is drifting through deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its reactor is gone. Power is failing. Your crew is stranded.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One experimental system still functions: a prototype drive capable of reaching alternate realities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere in another universe lies the technology you need to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The question isn't whether you'll find it...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's what you'll leave behind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cooperative Procedural FPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/18ed47fb4e42964bd542e935a28a4d34.poster.avif?t=1783144152\" width=1166 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/18ed47fb4e42964bd542e935a28a4d34.webm?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/18ed47fb4e42964bd542e935a28a4d34.mp4?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alongside your friends through intense first-person combat against alien infestations, rogue machines, and hostile environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition takes you to <strong>a different version of reality</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations evolve between visits with new layouts, objectives, enemy encounters, environmental hazards, and secrets. Procedural generation isn't just a gameplay system—it's woven directly into the story of the multiverse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two realities are ever quite the same.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Engine</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/ddbbcd17f47eb08ac073a8ae60b58aa8.poster.avif?t=1783144152\" width=1166 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/ddbbcd17f47eb08ac073a8ae60b58aa8.webm?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/ddbbcd17f47eb08ac073a8ae60b58aa8.mp4?t=1783144152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission offers meaningful choices that shape your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful upgrades, unlock new technologies, and create devastating combinations as you prepare for increasingly dangerous expeditions and massive boss encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master new weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push deeper into the multiverse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Choice Has Consequences</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/b780434c0a0cfd799c6dfb5f7de960c7.poster.avif?t=1783144152\" width=1166 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1561540/extras/b780434c0a0cfd799c6dfb5f7de960c7.webm?t=178314